    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d2-a3">

                <pb facs="0114" n="6" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg6"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No.
                        353—Telegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Moerser to Mr.
                            Grant.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Krakau.</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-02-27"
                    >undated</date>].</dateline></opener>
                <p>Papers proving identity and money taken from my son by the police. He also
                    arrested. Request speedy help. Papers to be demanded by telegraph. Answer
                    paid.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moerser.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
